## A comprehensive .gitignore for DCEMS project
## including .NET, Node.js/React, Visual Studio Code configurations,
## environment files, build artifacts, and logs.
## 
## IMPORTANT: This file intentionally includes documentation folders (docs/, .agent/)
## because they contain technical specifications required for development.

# =============================================================================
# BUILD ARTIFACTS & COMPILED CODE
# =============================================================================

# .NET Build Results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core Artifacts
artifacts/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages (optional - uncomment if needed)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# =============================================================================
# NODE.JS / REACT FRONTEND BUILD ARTIFACTS
# =============================================================================

# npm/yarn build outputs
dist/
build/

# Node modules (can be selective based on team policy)
node_modules/

# Vite build output
public/

# TypeScript cache
*.tsbuildinfo

# Coverage reports
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Environment variable files
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# IDE specific configurations (VS Code)
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# =============================================================================
# .NET PROJECT SPECIFIC FILES
# =============================================================================

# Solution file backup
*.suo
*.user
*.userossc
*.sln.doc

# Visual Studio cache files
.vs/
*.rsproj.user

# Web application archive
wwwroot.zip

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# Code coverage
CodeCoverage/

# MSTest test results
<Tt>est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# xUnit
xunit.runner.report.xml
xunit.runner.trx.xml

# =============================================================================
# DO NOT IGNORE DOCUMENTATION FOLDERS
# =============================================================================

## docs/ folder is intentionally tracked - contains technical specifications
docs/SRS.md
docs/ERD.md
docs/API_SPEC.md
docs/DATABASE_DESIGN.md
docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
docs/TEST_PLAN.md

## .agent/ folder is intentionally tracked - agent memory files
.agent/PROJECT_RULES.md
.agent/PROJECT_STATE.md
.agent/TASKS.md
.agent/DECISIONS.md
.agent/HANDOFF.md
.agent/ARCHITECTURE.md
.agent/KNOWN_ISSUES.md

# =============================================================================
# SECRETS & CREDENTIALS (REMOVE BEFORE COMMIT)
# =============================================================================

## Database connection strings with passwords
*.db.config
*.db.settings
AppService.db.config

## API keys and tokens
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json

# =============================================================================
# IDE / EDITOR CONFIGURATIONS
# =============================================================================

## Visual Studio settings
.vs/
User.suo
User.user

## VS Code local settings (keep in repo for team consistency)
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json

## JetBrains IDEs
.idea/

# =============================================================================
# OPERATING SYSTEM FILES
# =============================================================================

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# =============================================================================
# SERIAL PORT CONFIGURATIONS (OPTIONAL)
# =============================================================================

## Serial port data files (if created during development)
*.ser
*.hex
portconfig.json